{"type":"before","callId":"call@206","startTime":87216.4,"class":"Frame","method":"fill","params":{"selector":"input[placeholder=\"Add your own…\"] >> nth=0","strict":true,"value":"The product in question is an all-in-one digital workspace platform called 'Elevate', which currently offers a suite of tools and features for remote teams to collaborate, communicate, and manage projects efficiently. Elevate provides a centralized hub for team members to access shared files, calendars, and task lists, as well as integrate with popular third-party apps like Google Drive, Slack, and Trello. The platform also includes features such as automated workflows, customizable dashboards, and real-time analytics to help teams stay organized and on track. With the new features we're considering adding, we aim to enhance the user experience, improve collaboration, and increase productivity for our users. Specifically, we're looking to integrate AI-powered project management tools, a built-in time tracking system, and a more intuitive user interface to make it easier for users to find the features they need. These additions will not only make Elevate more competitive in the market but also provide our users with a more comprehensive and user-friendly experience.","timeout":0},"stepId":"pw:api@126","pageId":"page@ff8c2321090d3af8e10d810414a8a9e5","beforeSnapshot":"before@call@206"}
