auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},[[277,43]],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0  mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full"},[[277,75]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},[[277,79]],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full justify-start items-start flex-col mt-[8px] h-[24px] relative overflow-visible","style":"opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between items-start pointer-events-none","style":"opacity: 1;"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] -ml-[5px] pointer-events-auto"},[[277,81]],["BUTTON",{"class":"relative group flex items-center justify-center w-[24px] h-[24px] rounded-[8px] overflow-visible opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed","disabled":""},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"flex-shrink-0 bg-[#808080] transition-colors duration-200 ","style":"width: 14px; height: 14px; mask-image: url(\"/icons/retry_2.svg\"); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center;"}]]]]],[[277,87]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-end pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0 mb-4 mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":" justify-center mt-6 mb-6 items-start w-full bg-[#F7FBFF] rounded-[12px] border border-[#C4C7C780] "},["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"1"],". ","What product, service, app, or platform will these new features belong to? Please describe what it currently offers and what you are considering adding."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"The product in question is an all-in-one digital workspace platform called 'Elevate', which currently offers a suite of tools and features for remote teams to collaborate, communicate, and manage projects efficiently. Elevate provides a centralized hub for team members to access shared files, calendars, and task lists, as well as integrate with popular third-party apps like Google Drive, Slack, and Trello. The platform also includes features such as automated workflows, customizable dashboards, and real-time analytics to help teams stay organized and on track. With the new features we're considering adding, we aim to enhance the user experience, improve collaboration, and increase productivity for our users. Specifically, we're looking to integrate AI-powered project management tools, a built-in time tracking system, and a more intuitive user interface to make it easier for users to find the features they need. These additions will not only make Elevate more competitive in the market but also provide our users with a more comprehensive and user-friendly experience."]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"2"],". ","Which feature areas should the survey explore? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Meal planning and recipe suggestions, Grocery lists, shopping, or delivery, Nutrition, calorie, or dietary tracking, Personalised plans based on goals or restrictions"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"3"],". ","Who should answer the survey? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"People who regularly cook at home, People who meal-prep in advance, People following a specific diet or nutrition goal, Existing users of the product or service, Potential users who do not use it today"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"4"],". ","What is the single most important decision this research should support?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Understand unmet meal-preparation needs"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"5"],". ","What should the survey mainly measure? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Current dietary habits and meal-prep routines, Pain points and barriers, Interest in proposed features, Willingness to pay or preferred pricing"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"6"],". ","What is the timeline for this research?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Medium-term (about 1 month)"]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"mt-2 flex w-full min-w-0 max-w-full flex-col ml-0 sm:ml-[12px]","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8.70548px);"},["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 w-full max-w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full min-w-0 max-w-full mt-[12px]"},["STYLE",{},"\n/* One sweep (~2.7s), then a ~0.3s rest, per 3s iteration. The travel is exactly one\n   tile period (background-size 200% → a 200% shift), so the loop point is\n   seamless. The rest frames hold at 200% ≡ 0%, where the visible window shows\n   only the gradient's flat #B8B8B8 half (highlight lives in the 50–100% stops),\n   so nothing is frozen mid-text during the pause — the text just sits gray. */\n@keyframes ws-shimmer-sweep { 0% { background-position: 0% 0; animation-timing-function: ease-in-out; } 90% { background-position: 200% 0; } 100% { background-position: 200% 0; } }\n@keyframes ws-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n@keyframes ws-fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n.ws-fade-in { animation: ws-fade-in 0.45s ease-out both; }\n.ws-spin-anim { animation: ws-spin 0.7s linear infinite; }\n/* Header icon shimmer — exactly synced with the title ShimmerText: same gradient\n   (#B8B8B8 base, #464646 sweeping highlight), same background-size, same keyframe\n   and 3s timing. The icon SVG is the mask, so the gradient fills the icon's\n   shape (replaces its color while streaming, mirroring the text clip). */\n.ws-icon-shimmer {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #464646 0%, #464646 50%, #B8B8B8 75%, #464646 100%);\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: ws-shimmer-sweep 3s linear infinite;\n}\n/* Recolorable icon — a single masked span whose background-color IS the icon\n   color. Two clear states: mid-gray #6B6B6B at rest, darkening to the text's\n   hover color #343434 on header hover. (Matching the text's #464646→#343434\n   exactly was imperceptible — text hover reads via font-weight, icons can't do\n   that, so they need a wider color gap.) One element for both states, so the\n   icon's size/position can't shift on hover. */\n.ws-icon-tint {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-color: #6B6B6B;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.group:hover .ws-icon-tint { background-color: #343434; }\n.ws-scroll { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #B0B0B0 #ECECEC; overscroll-behavior-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-y; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; -webkit-appearance: none; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #ECECEC; border-radius: 4px; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #B0B0B0; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #ECECEC; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #9A9A9A; }\n"],["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[6px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block flex-shrink-0","style":"width: 13px; height: 13px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-shimmer","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/leaf.svg\");"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_mono_dc771075-module__pIk42a__className text-[13px] font-normal leading-[140%] tracking-normal"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-normal","style":"display: inline-block; background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(70, 70, 70) 0%, rgb(70, 70, 70) 50%, rgb(184, 184, 184) 75%, rgb(70, 70, 70) 100%); background-size: 200% 100%; background-repeat: repeat; background-clip: text; color: transparent; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; animation: 3s linear 0s infinite normal none running ws-shimmer-sweep;"},"Remember to breathe, please"]]]]]],["DIV",{"style":"height: 300px;"}],[[300,191]]]]]],["DIV",{"id":"questionnaire-floating-anchor","class":"w-full relative flex fle