["DIV",{"class":"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between items-start pointer-events-none","style":"opacity: 1;"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] -ml-[5px] pointer-events-auto"},[[69,77]],["BUTTON",{"class":"relative group flex items-center justify-center w-[24px] h-[24px] rounded-[8px] overflow-visible opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed","disabled":""},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"flex-shrink-0 bg-[#808080] transition-colors duration-200 ","style":"width: 14px; height: 14px; mask-image: url(\"/icons/retry_2.svg\"); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center;"}]]]]],[[69,83]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-end pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0 mb-4 mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":" justify-center mt-6 mb-6 items-start w-full bg-[#F7FBFF] rounded-[12px] border border-[#C4C7C780] "},["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"1"],". ","Which product should this survey focus on, and what is its correct name? Please describe the product or service in your own words."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"The product in question is an e-learning platform called 'LearnSphere' that offers a comprehensive online education experience for students of all ages. Currently, LearnSphere provides a vast library of video courses, interactive quizzes, and personalized learning plans tailored to individual students' needs. It also features a social learning component that allows students to connect with peers, ask questions, and collaborate on projects. The platform is accessible on both web and mobile devices, making it convenient for students to learn on-the-go. Our team is considering adding several new features to LearnSphere, including an AI-powered adaptive learning engine that can adjust the difficulty level and content of courses based on a student's performance, a virtual reality (VR) and augmented reality (AR) component that can enhance the learning experience through immersive simulations, and a gamification feature that rewards students for achieving milestones and completing challenging tasks. We also plan to integrate LearnSphere with popular productivity and organization tools, such as Google Calendar and Trello, to help students better manage their time and stay organized. Additionally, we aim to expand the platform's content offerings to include more courses and resources on emerging technologies, such as artificial intelligence, blockchain, and cybersecurity."]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"2"],". ","What should the survey primarily evaluate?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Both current satisfaction and interest in new features"]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"mt-2 flex w-full min-w-0 max-w-full flex-col ml-0 sm:ml-[12px]","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(9.66585px);"},["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 w-full max-w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full min-w-0 max-w-full mt-[12px]"},["STYLE",{},"\n/* One sweep (~2.7s), then a ~0.3s rest, per 3s iteration. The travel is exactly one\n   tile period (background-size 200% → a 200% shift), so the loop point is\n   seamless. The rest frames hold at 200% ≡ 0%, where the visible window shows\n   only the gradient's flat #B8B8B8 half (highlight lives in the 50–100% stops),\n   so nothing is frozen mid-text during the pause — the text just sits gray. */\n@keyframes ws-shimmer-sweep { 0% { background-position: 0% 0; animation-timing-function: ease-in-out; } 90% { background-position: 200% 0; } 100% { background-position: 200% 0; } }\n@keyframes ws-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n@keyframes ws-fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n.ws-fade-in { animation: ws-fade-in 0.45s ease-out both; }\n.ws-spin-anim { animation: ws-spin 0.7s linear infinite; }\n/* Header icon shimmer — exactly synced with the title ShimmerText: same gradient\n   (#B8B8B8 base, #464646 sweeping highlight), same background-size, same keyframe\n   and 3s timing. The icon SVG is the mask, so the gradient fills the icon's\n   shape (replaces its color while streaming, mirroring the text clip). */\n.ws-icon-shimmer {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #464646 0%, #464646 50%, #B8B8B8 75%, #464646 100%);\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: ws-shimmer-sweep 3s linear infinite;\n}\n/* Recolorable icon — a single masked span whose background-color IS the icon\n   color. Two clear states: mid-gray #6B6B6B at rest, darkening to the text's\n   hover color #343434 on header hover. (Matching the text's #464646→#343434\n   exactly was imperceptible — text hover reads via font-weight, icons can't do\n   that, so they need a wider color gap.) One element for both states, so the\n   icon's size/position can't shift on hover. */\n.ws-icon-tint {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-color: #6B6B6B;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.group:hover .ws-icon-tint { background-color: #343434; }\n.ws-scroll { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #B0B0B0 #ECECEC; overscroll-behavior-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-y; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; -webkit-appearance: none; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #ECECEC; border-radius: 4px; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #B0B0B0; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #ECECEC; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #9A9A9A; }\n"],["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[6px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block flex-shrink-0","style":"width: 13px; height: 13px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-shimmer","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/leaf.svg\");"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_mono_dc771075-module__pIk42a__className text-[13px] font-normal leading-[140%] tracking-normal"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-normal","style":"display: inline-block; background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(70, 70, 70) 0%, rgb(70, 70, 70) 50%, rgb(184, 184, 184) 75%, rgb(70, 70, 70) 100%); background-size: 200% 100%; background-repeat: repeat; background-clip: text; color: transparent; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; animation: 3s linear 0s infinite normal none running ws-shimmer-sweep;"},"Gathering the infinity stones"]]]]]],["DIV",{"style":"height: 300px;"}],[[554,191]]]]]],["DIV",{"id":"questionnaire-floating-anchor","class":"w-full relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mb-[19px] md:mt-0 "},["DIV",{"class":"border border-transparent w-full max-w-[800px] flex flex-col"},["DIV",{"class":"relative w-full flex justify-center"},["DIV",{"class":"relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center"},[[554,196]],["DIV",{"class":" w-full bg-white md:w-full shadow-[0px_1px_42px_0px_#00000012] border-[0.6px] border-[#BFBFBF] rounded-[12px] md:rounded-[20px] px-[10px] md:px-5 py-[10px] md:py-4 sticky bottom-5 z-10   overflow-visible max-w-[800px] max-h-[460px]"},[[554,198]],["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center justify-between  mt-[24px]"},[[554,210]],["DIV",{"class":"relative"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"relative inline-flex group"},["BUTTON",{"aria-label":"submit button","class":"flex w-9 h-9 md:w-8 md:h-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] p-[7px_7.9px_7.6px_7px] shadow-none md:shadow-[0px_4px_8px_0px_#00000026] transition-transform will-change-transform ease-[cubic-bezier(0.165,0.85,0.45,1)] duration-150 hover:scale-y-[1.015] hover:scale-x-[1.005] active:scale-[0.985] hover:bg-[radial-gradient(at_bottom,hsla(0_0%_100%_/0.20),hsla(0_0%_100%_/0))] active:bg-[radial-gradient(at_bottom,hsla(0_0%_100%_/0.28),hsla(0_0%_100%_/0))] cursor-pointer caret-black bg-black -mb-[2px]"},["DIV",{"class":"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center","style":""},["DIV",{"class":"w-2 h-2 bg-black rounded-[1px]"}]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]],[[570,474]],[[570,475]],[[570,476]]],[[570,623]],[[531,151]],[[554,236]],[[531,152]],[[246,116]],[[169,78]],[[69,144]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":189640.239,"wallTime":1786698601249,"collectionTime":1,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
