. Currently, GreenCycle offers a wide range of products, including reusable bags, refillable water bottles, bamboo toothbrushes, and biodegradable cleaning supplies. The platform allows customers to browse and purchase products through its user-friendly website and mobile app. GreenCycle also features a rewards program, where customers can earn points for every purchase and redeem them for discounts and free products. Additionally, the platform offers a 'Product of the Month' subscription service, where customers can receive a new, eco-friendly product every month. We are considering adding new features to GreenCycle, including a 'Product Recommendation' algorithm that suggests products to customers based on their purchase history and preferences, a 'Sustainability Score' feature that rates products based on their environmental impact, and a 'Community Forum' where customers can discuss sustainable living and share tips and advice."}],[[1,3]]],[[272,110]]]]]]]]]]]]]]],[[873,474]],[[873,475]],[[873,476]]],[[873,623]],[[834,151]],[[857,236]],[[834,152]],[[549,116]],[[472,78]],[[372,144]],[[295,82]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":242224.306,"wallTime":1786698653833,"collectionTime":1.399999976158142,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
