IV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0  mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full"},[[69,87]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},[[69,91]],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full justify-start items-start flex-col mt-[8px] h-[24px] relative overflow-visible","style":"opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between items-start pointer-events-none","style":"opacity: 1;"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] -ml-[5px] pointer-events-auto"},[[69,93]],["BUTTON",{"class":"relative group flex items-center justify-center w-[24px] h-[24px] rounded-[8px] overflow-visible opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed","disabled":""},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"flex-shrink-0 bg-[#808080] transition-colors duration-200 ","style":"width: 14px; height: 14px; mask-image: url(\"/icons/retry_2.svg\"); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center;"}]]]]],[[69,99]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-end pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0 mb-4 mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":" justify-center mt-6 mb-6 items-start w-full bg-[#F7FBFF] rounded-[12px] border border-[#C4C7C780] "},["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"1"],". ","Which product or service is this survey actually about? Please describe the one you want to research: LearnSphere, GreenCycle, or another product/service."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"The product in question is an e-learning platform called 'LearnSphere' that offers a comprehensive online education experience for students of all ages. Currently, LearnSphere provides access to a vast library of video lectures, interactive quizzes, and personalized learning plans, all tailored to meet the unique needs of each student. The platform also features a social learning component, allowing students to connect with peers and instructors, as well as a progress tracking system to monitor their academic growth. With the new features we are considering adding, we aim to enhance the overall user experience, increase engagement, and provide more effective learning outcomes. Specifically, we are looking to integrate AI-powered adaptive learning tools, real-time feedback mechanisms, and gamification elements to make the learning process more enjoyable and interactive. We also plan to expand our content offerings to include more specialized courses and certifications, as well as partner with leading educational institutions to provide students with access to high-quality, industry-recognized content. Ultimately, our goal is to create a seamless, intuitive, and supportive learning environment that empowers students to achieve their full potential and succeed in their academic and professional pursuits."]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"2"],". ","What is the single most important decision this research should support?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Improve the current customer or learner experience"]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"mt-2 flex w-full min-w-0 max-w-full flex-col ml-0 sm:ml-[12px]","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(9.39138px);"},["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 w-full max-w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full min-w-0 max-w-full mt-[12px]"},["STYLE",{},"\n/* One sweep (~2.7s), then a ~0.3s rest, per 3s iteration. The travel is exactly one\n   tile period (background-size 200% → a 200% shift), so the loop point is\n   seamless. The rest frames hold at 200% ≡ 0%, where the visible window shows\n   only the gradient's flat #B8B8B8 half (highlight lives in the 50–100% stops),\n   so nothing is frozen mid-text during the pause — the text just sits gray. */\n@keyframes ws-shimmer-sweep { 0% { background-position: 0% 0; animation-timing-function: ease-in-out; } 90% { background-position: 200% 0; } 100% { background-position: 200% 0; } }\n@keyframes ws-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n@keyframes ws-fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n.ws-fade-in { animation: ws-fade-in 0.45s ease-out both; }\n.ws-spin-anim { animation: ws-spin 0.7s linear infinite; }\n/* Header icon shimmer — exactly synced with the title ShimmerText: same gradient\n   (#B8B8B8 base, #464646 sweeping highlight), same background-size, same keyframe\n   and 3s timing. The icon SVG is the mask, so the gradient fills the icon's\n   shape (replaces its color while streaming, mirroring the text clip). */\n.ws-icon-shimmer {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #464646 0%, #464646 50%, #B8B8B8 75%, #464646 100%);\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: ws-shimmer-sweep 3s linear infinite;\n}\n/* Recolorable icon — a single masked span whose background-color IS the icon\n   color. Two clear states: mid-gray #6B6B6B at rest, darkening to the text's\n   hover color #343434 on header hover. (Matching the text's #464646→#343434\n   exactly was imperceptible — text hover reads via font-weight, icons can't do\n   that, so they need a wider color gap.) One element for both states, so the\n   icon's size/position can't shift on hover. */\n.ws-icon-tint {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-color: #6B6B6B;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.group:hover .ws-icon-tint { background-color: #343434; }\n.ws-scroll { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #B0B0B0 #ECECEC; overscroll-behavior-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-y; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; -webkit-appearance: none; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #ECECEC; border-radius: 4px; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #B0B0B0; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #ECECEC; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #9A9A9A; }\n"],["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[6px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block flex-shrink-0","style":"width: 13px; height: 13px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-shimmer","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/leaf.svg\");"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_mono_dc771075-module__pIk42a__className text-[13px] font-normal leading-[140%] tracking-normal"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-normal","style":"display: inline-block; background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(70, 70, 70) 0%, rgb(70, 70, 70) 50%, rgb(184, 184, 184) 75%, rgb(70, 70, 70) 100%); background-size: 200% 100%; background-repeat: repeat; background-clip: text; color: transparent; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; animation: 3s linear 0s infinite normal none running ws-shimmer-sweep;"},"I'm thinking it, hold your horses"]]]]]],["DIV",{"style":"height: 300px;"}],[[938,191]]]]]],["DIV",{"id":"questionnaire-floating-anchor","class":"w-full relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mb-[19px] md:mt-0 "},["DIV",{"class":"border border-transparent w-full max-w-[800px] flex flex-col"},["DIV",{"class":"relative w-full flex justify-center"},["DIV",{"class":"relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center"},[[938,196]],["DIV",{"class":" w-full bg-white md:w-full shadow-[0px_1px_42px_0px_#00000012] border-[0.6px] border-[#BFBFBF] rounded-[12px] md:rounded-[20px] px-[10px] md:px-5 py-[10px] md:py-4 sticky bottom-5 z-10   overflow-visible max-w-[800px] max-h-[460px]"},[[938,198]],["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center justify-between  mt-[24px]"},[[938,210]],["DIV",{"class":"relative"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"relative inline-flex group"},["BUTTON",{"aria-label":"submit button","class":"flex w-9 h-9 md:w-8 md:h-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] p-[7px_7.9px_7.6px_7px] shadow-none md:shadow-[0px_4px_8px_0px_#00000026] transition-transform will-change-transform ease-[cubic-bezier(0.165,0.85,0.45,1)] duration-150 hover:scale-y-[1.015] hover:scale-x-[1.005] active:scale-[0.985] hover:bg-[radial-gradient(at_bottom,hsla(0_0%_100%_/0.20),hsla(0_0%_100%_/0))] active:bg-[radial-gradient(at_bottom,hsla(0_0%_100%_/0.28),hsla(0_0%_100%_/0))] cursor-pointer caret-black bg-black -mb-[2px]"},["DIV",{"class":"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center","style":""},["DIV",{"class":"w-2 h-2 bg-black rounded-[1px]"}]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]],[[954,474]],[[954,475]],[[954,476]]],[[954,623]],[[915,151]],[[938,236]],[[915,152]],[[630,116]],[[553,78]],[[453,144]],[[376,82]],[[69,160]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":261051.758,"wallTime":1786698672659,"collectionTime":2,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
