{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"call@1514","snapshotName":"after@call@1514","pageId":"page@ff8c2321090d3af8e10d810414a8a9e5","frameId":"frame@54de47afbe888a909afd57407ac3d1ae","frameUrl":"https://dev.hercules.works/ai/chat/e024bd98-0387-4ac2-87a9-434265ef3921","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","class":"scrollbar-hide","data-scroll-behavior":"smooth","style":""},[[1414,31]],["BODY",{"class":"inter_ad991c7-module__LhgUwq__className inter_ad991c7-module__LhgUwq__variable roboto_20913b7b-module__RNtCNq__variable jetbrains_mono_68d574a-module__ggYvfa__variable","style":"overflow: unset;"},[[1414,32]],[[1453,57]],["DIV",{"id":"main-content"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full bg-white flex-col h-[100dvh] overflow-hidden overflow-x-clip relative z-[11]","style":"opacity: 1; transform: none;"},[[1437,45]],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full bg-white flex-col flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-hidden overflow-x-clip relative z-[11]"},["MAIN",{"id":"main-content","class":"flex flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto overflow-x-clip relative w-full justify-end items-end "},[[1414,42]],["DIV",{"class":"h-full relative min-w-0 p-0 ","style":"width: 1235px; height: 720px; transition: width 300ms ease-in-out;"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full h-full overflow-hidden relative"},["DIV",{"class":"h-full flex overflow-visible","style":"width: 100%; transition: width 300ms ease-in-out;"},["DIV",{"class":"relative w-full flex flex-col items-center mx-0 md:mx-[2%] h-full min-h-0 overflow-hidden justify-between"},["DIV",{"class":" flex-1   w-[95%] md:w-full min-h-0 mb-0 md:-mb-20 flex justify-center"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full md:w-[90%] flex flex-col z-[0] flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-x-hidden items-center"},["DIV",{"__playwright_scroll_top_":"9420.5","class":"flex justify-center min-h-0 w-[96%]  overflow-y-auto overflow-x-hidden scrollbar-hide z-10 items-center pt-4 "},["DIV",{"class":"w-full md:max-w-[820px] h-full"},[[1437,139]],[[468,0]],[[9,10]],[[178,6]],[[9,21]],[[468,24]],[[9,32]],[[468,36]],[[9,43]],[[468,48]],[[9,54]],[[468,60]],[[9,65]],[[468,72]],[[9,76]],[[168,129]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-start pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},[[22,77]],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0  mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"mb-8 pointer-events-auto"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full max-w-[800px] mt-[12px]"},[[22,79]],[[22,88]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"ml-[16px] mt-4 mb-[10px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col min-w-0"},[[22,103]],[[22,118]],["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},[[22,122]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 "},[[22,125]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 max-w-full break-words"},["DIV",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className mt-3 min-w-0 max-w-full break-words text-[12px] text-[#464646] leading-[160%]"},["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"1. Core Objective & Business Context"],[[22,128]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Business problem:"]," LearnSphere needs to understand why learners do not sustain engagement or complete courses, and which parts of the learning experience most influence continued progress."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Research scope:"]," The study will examine content relevance, learning formats, adaptive tools, progress feedback, social learning, gamification, and the experience of current, former, potential, and decision-influencing stakeholders."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Why this matters now:"]," The research has been triggered by learner complaints, low engagement or completion, upcoming feature planning, competitive pressure, and possible expansion into certifications or institutional partnerships. These pressures require LearnSphere to distinguish genuine experience problems from unmet expectations or differences between learner groups."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"What knowing the answer enables:"]," LearnSphere will be able to identify the strongest barriers to course completion, separate issues affecting current learners from reasons for inactivity or non-adoption, and prioritize product improvements that are most likely to increase sustained engagement."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Important stakeholder distinction:"]," Learners should provide the primary experience and completion evidence. Parents or guardians, teachers, and academic administrators should be routed to separate role-appropriate modules rather than being combined into a single learner satisfaction score."],"\n"],[[22,156]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"2. Secondary Research Snapshot"],[[22,159]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Digital learning engagement requires more than platform access:"]," The OECD identifies engagement as a central challenge in digital learning and highlights the need to measure engagement and design interventions when disengagement begins. This supports measuring specific drop-off moments, not only overall satisfaction. — OECD Digital Education Outlook (",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"https://www.oecd.org/en/publications/oecd-digital-education-outlook-2021_589b283f-en/full-report/component-7.html","node":"[object Object]"},"oecd.org"],")"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"India has a large and increasingly structured digital-learning ecosystem:"]," The Government of India’s PM e-VIDYA initiative brings together multiple digital and online education channels and is designed to benefit nearly 25 crore school-going children. LearnSphere should therefore benchmark against both commercial platforms and public or institution-linked learning alternatives. — Ministry of Education, Government of India (",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"https://pmevidya.education.gov.in/","node":"[object Object]"},"pmevidya.education.gov.in"],")"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Institutional and educator use is strategically relevant:"]," DIKSHA operates across 35 states and union territories and provides large volumes of curriculum-linked digital content, showing why teacher, administrator, curriculum alignment, and partnership expectations may become important for LearnSphere’s expansion plans. — Press Information Bureau, Government of India (",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"http://dsel.education.gov.in/sites/default/files/update/PIB2036640.pdf","node":"[object Object]"},"dsel.education.gov.in"],")"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"AI and personalized support are becoming important parts of online learning value propositions:"]," Coursera’s 2025 learner-outcomes research reports that 94% of full-time professionals who completed GenAI content reported a positive impact at work, while 94% of users of its AI coaching feature said it improved their learning experience. These are provider-sponsored findings, so LearnSphere should test whether its own AI tools create measurable engagement value rather than assuming that AI is inherently motivating. — Coursera and The Harris Poll (",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"https://www.coursera.org/enterprise/resources/ebook/learner-outcomes","node":"[object Object]"},"coursera.org"],", ",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"https://assets.ctfassets.net/00atxywtfxvd/2eocGVEBKQlIHuLNaSuK1l/18f31949bff069d78a22daf8869566b7/2025-coursera-learner-outcomes-report.pdf","node":"[object Object]"},"assets.ctfassets.net"],")"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Competitive pressure is likely to come from several directions:"]," LearnSphere may compete not only with direct online-learning platforms but also with public digital resources, institutional learning systems, creator-led content, coaching platforms, and informal peer-learning communities. The survey should therefore measure alternatives used and the specific reasons users switch or divide their learning time."],"\n"],[[22,202]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"3. Research Type & Methodology"],[[22,205]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Study type:"]," Mixed-method ",["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Customer Experience / Learner Experience"],", ",["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Usage & Attitude"],", and ",["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Feature or Experience Prioritization"]," research."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Stimulus count:"]," The current brief contains zero discrete stimuli to show. The listed areas are experience domains, not specific concepts, screens, feature designs, or competing assets. Therefore, cell-based designs such as monadic, sequential monadic, A/B, or paired comparison do not apply at this stage."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Research design:"]," A linear, modular questionnaire with role-based routing and a general-to-specific funnel."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Why this approach:"]," The main decision is how to improve learner engagement and course completion, which requires behavioral evidence, journey diagnosis, satisfaction drivers, and barriers rather than a simple preference test. A modular design will allow current learners, inactive learners, potential users, parents, and educators to answer only the sections relevant to their relationship with LearnSphere."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Feature-prioritization overlay:"]," If LearnSphere provides a defined list of at least five candidate features or improvements, a MaxDiff exercise should be added to produce a clearer preference hierarchy. This should be treated as a prioritization module, not as a stimulus-cell test."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Alternatives considered:"],"\n",["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Pure monadic testing:"]," Not selected because no discrete concepts, designs, or feature prototypes are currently specified."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Sequential monadic testing:"]," Not selected because respondents are not being asked to evaluate multiple independent assets."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Conjoint or choice-based conjoint:"]," Not selected because the current decision concerns experience improvement and completion barriers, not quantified trade-offs between product configurations and prices."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Standalone NPS or CSAT survey:"]," Not selected because a single score would not explain the behavioral causes of disengagement, inactivity, or incomplete courses."],"\n"],"\n"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"User control:"]," If you prefer a different methodology, such as adding a MaxDiff feature-prioritization exercise or testing specific product prototypes, the design can be switched before the research brief is generated."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Survey design logic:"]," Begin with recent behavior and usage context, then measure the learning journey, followed by satisfaction and engagement drivers. Ask unaided barriers and reasons before presenting structured response options where possible. Current and former learners should receive different paths; potential users should not be asked to rate experiences they have not had. Parents, teachers, and administrators should receive role-specific questions about influence, learning outcomes, implementation, and support needs."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Quality controls:"]," Use platform attention checks, speeder detection, straight-line detection, minimum completion-time rules, and open-ended gibberish screening. Long or complex batteries should be split across short mobile-friendly screens, with answer options randomized where order effects are not meaningful."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Fielding context:"]," The survey will be deployed to verified Indian respondents through the SuperJ mobile application and web. Age, gender, city, and NCCS targeting should be enforced by the audience system rather than recollected in the questionnaire. Routing, randomization, quotas, attention checks, and media support are available if later product or interface assets are added."],"\n"],[[22,290]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"4. Target Audience Profile"],[[22,293]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Current LearnSphere students:"]," Active learners with recent platform experience who can evaluate content quality, learning formats, feedback, adaptive tools, social learning, and the moments that support or interrupt progress."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Former or inactive LearnSphere students:"]," People who have stopped using LearnSphere or failed to complete a course. They are essential for identifying disengagement triggers, unmet expectations, friction points, competing alternatives, and realistic win-back opportunities."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Potential users:"]," People who fit the intended learning need but do not currently use LearnSphere. They can reveal awareness, category expectations, perceived barriers, competing solutions, and what proof would be needed to try the platform."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Parents or guardians:"]," Individuals who influence learning decisions, particularly where the learner is a minor or where household approval, payment, trust, safety, or academic credibility affects adoption."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Teachers, instructors, and academic administrators:"]," Stakeholders who can assess curriculum fit, teaching usefulness, learner monitoring, feedback quality, institutional integration, and partnership readiness."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Why these groups matter:"]," Engagement and completion are not shaped only by the learner interface. Trust, course relevance, instructional quality, feedback, household influence, and institutional support may all affect sustained use."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Must-have screening criteria:"]," Confirm respondent role, familiarity with LearnSphere, current or past usage, recent course or learning activity where applicable, involvement in learning decisions, and whether the respondent has enough experience to answer the relevant module."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Reporting principle:"]," Results should be reported separately by stakeholder role and LearnSphere relationship. Combining all groups into one overall average would risk masking the reasons different groups support, reject, or abandon the platform."],"\n"],[[22,336]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"5. Key Information Areas & Data Architecture"],[[22,339]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Engagement and completion behavior:"]," Capture recent login or learning frequency, course-start behavior, lesson completion, quiz participation, progress consistency, and where applicable the point at which learning stopped. → Reveals the difference between stated engagement and actual learning behavior. → Drives targeted retention and completion interventions."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Learning journey friction:"]," Measure difficulty finding the right course, onboarding clarity, navigation, lesson length, technical interruptions, scheduling barriers, and resuming unfinished learning. → Identifies operational friction that may be mistaken for low motivation. → Drives journey and interface improvements."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Content quality and course relevance:"]," Assess relevance to learner goals, clarity, depth, difficulty, curriculum fit, instructor quality, and perceived usefulness. → Shows whether learners disengage because the content does not deliver enough value. → Drives curriculum refresh, course design, and content investment."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Learning format effectiveness:"]," Compare perceived usefulness of video lectures, quizzes, learning plans, practice activities, and other instructional formats using behavioral and outcome-oriented questions. → Identifies which formats support understanding and continued progress. → Drives learning-design priorities rather than popularity-led feature decisions."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Adaptive learning, feedback, and progress visibility:"]," Measure whether AI recommendations, personalized paths, real-time feedback, reminders, dashboards, and progress tracking are noticed, understood, trusted, and acted upon. → Separates feature awareness from genuine behavioral impact. → Drives improvements to personalization, feedback timing, transparency, and motivation loops."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Social learning and gamification:"]," Assess the role of peer interaction, instructor access, discussion, badges, streaks, points, challenges, and recognition. → Reveals which engagement mechanisms create meaningful learning momentum versus superficial activity. → Drives community and gamification design decisions."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Reasons for inactivity and alternatives:"]," Capture primary and secondary reasons for stopping or not starting, competing platforms or offline options used, and what would make the respondent return or try LearnSphere. → Reveals churn triggers, switching dynamics, and unmet expectations. → Drives retention, win-back, positioning, and acquisition strategy."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Feature and improvement prioritization:"]," If a defined list is supplied, use MaxDiff or a structured forced trade-off to prioritize improvements such as better content relevance, shorter lessons, stronger feedback, improved AI recommendations, peer interaction, certifications, or institutional tools. → Produces a relative priority hierarchy instead of inflated ratings across every feature. → Drives the next product-release roadmap."],"\n"],[[22,382]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"6. Survey Flow & Question Design Approach"],[[22,385]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 1 — Warm-up and screening:"]," Approximately 2-3 questions covering respondent role, LearnSphere familiarity, current or past usage, and recent learning activity. This establishes credibility before asking detailed evaluations."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 2 — Learning context and goals:"]," Approximately 3-4 questions covering learning objective, course type, expected outcome, study frequency, and the role of parents, teachers, or administrators where relevant. This provides the context needed to interpret completion behavior."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 3 — Current experience and journey:"]," Approximately 5-7 questions covering discovery, onboarding, course selection, content relevance, lesson experience, quizzes, learning plans, navigation, technical friction, and resuming interrupted learning. Current learners should answer the full path; former learners should be routed toward the point of drop-off."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 4 — Engagement and completion drivers:"]," Approximately 5-7 questions covering motivation, progress visibility, feedback, adaptive learning, social learning, gamification, instructor support, workload, confidence, and perceived learning progress. Behavioral anchors should be used so respondents identify what actually happened rather than simply agreeing that a feature sounds useful."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 5 — Stakeholder-specific modules:"],"\n",["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Potential users:"]," Awareness, alternatives, expectations, perceived barriers, trust, and trial requirements."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Parents or guardians:"]," Influence on choice, trust, safety, value, payment, academic credibility, and evidence of learner progress."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Teachers or administrators:"]," Curriculum fit, monitoring, feedback, teacher workload, implementation requirements, data visibility, and institutional partnership needs."],"\n"],"\n"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 6 — Improvement priorities and close:"]," Approximately 3-5 questions covering the single most important improvement, return or recommendation likelihood, open-ended reasons, and—if supplied—MaxDiff prioritization of candidate features. Close with an action-oriented improvement question rather than only a general satisfaction score."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Question design principles:"]," Use fully labelled 5-point unipolar scales where possible, avoid long agree/disagree grids, keep screens short for mobile completion, randomize non-ordered attribute lists, and use forced-choice or behavioral questions to validate positive claims."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Estimated length:"]," Approximately 18-25 questions for the main learner path, with shorter role-specific paths where possible. Target completion time is 8-12 minutes; modules should be cut rather than allowing the survey to become burdensome."],"\n"],[[22,446]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"7. Expected Insights & Business Decisions Enabled"],[[22,449]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to:"]," Identify the strongest behavioral and experience-level predictors of course engagement and completion."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to:"]," Quantify where current learners experience friction across onboarding, course discovery, lessons, quizzes, progress tracking, feedback, and resuming unfinished learning."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to:"]," Diagnose why former or inactive learners stopped using LearnSphere and distinguish product friction from content, motivation, scheduling, trust, or competitive reasons."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to:"]," Compare the needs of current learners, former learners, potential users, parents or guardians, and educators without blending incompatible perspectives."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to:"]," Determine whether AI-powered learning tools, progress tracking, social learning, and gamification are noticed, trusted, valued, and linked to continued use."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to:"]," Build an evidence-based priority list for the next product release, using MaxDiff if a defined set of candidate improvements is supplied."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to decide:"]," Which learner-experience problems should receive priority to improve engagement and course completion."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to decide:"]," Whether the next release should focus more heavily on content relevance, learning design, feedback and progress visibility, adaptive learning, social features, gamification, or journey friction."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to decide:"]," Which inactive learners are realistically recoverable and what type of intervention could bring them back."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to decide:"]," What evidence and capabilities LearnSphere must strengthen before expanding into certifications or institutional partnerships."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Key hypotheses being tested:"],"\n",["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Learners who perceive course content as relevant to their goals are more likely to sustain usage and complete courses."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Clear progress visibility and timely feedback reduce uncertainty and support continued learning."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Adaptive learning tools improve engagement only when learners understand and trust the recommendations."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Gamification and social learning influence completion differently across learner types and learning goals."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Former learners are more likely to have stopped because of content, time, journey, or value barriers than because of a single isolated feature problem."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Parents, teachers, and administrators evaluate LearnSphere using different success criteria from learners themselves."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Potential users require clearer proof of learning outcomes, credibility, relevance, or ease of use before trying the platform."],"\n"],"\n"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"KPIs to report:"]," Active-learning frequency, course-start-to-completion behavior, reported completion barriers, learner experience satisfaction, content relevance, ease of navigation, perceived learning progress, feedback usefulness, adaptive-tool usefulness and trust, social-learning value, gamification contribution, likelihood to continue, likelihood to return, likelihood to recommend, primary churn reasons, alternative-platform usage, and prioritized improvement utilities where MaxDiff is included."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Reporting requirement:"]," The final analysis should use role and lifecycle cuts—current, former, potential, parent or guardian, teacher, and administrator—and should identify which findings are common across groups versus specific to a particular stakeholder or learning stage."],"\n"]]]]]]]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},[[22,557]],[[9,496]],[[22,568]]]]]]]],[[9,519]],["DIV",{"class":"mt-2 flex w-full min-w-0 max-w-full flex-col ml-0 sm:ml-[12px]","style":"opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 w-full max-w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full min-w-0 max-w-full mt-[12px]"},[[9,521]],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"true","class":"group flex items-center cursor-pointer select-none"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[6px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block flex-shrink-0","style":"width: 13px; height: 13px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/leaf.svg\");"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_mono_dc771075-module__pIk42a__className flex items-center gap-[3px] text-[13px] font-normal leading-[140%] tracking-normal allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-normal","style":"display: inline-block; background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(70, 70, 70) 0%, rgb(70, 70, 70) 50%, rgb(184, 184, 184) 75%, rgb(70, 70, 70) 100%); background-size: 200% 100%; background-repeat: repeat; background-clip: text; color: transparent; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; animation: 3s linear 0s infinite normal none running ws-shimmer-sweep;"},"Going back out — the brief needs more context"]]],["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block self-center flex-shrink-0 ml-[4px] opacity-100 -scale-y-100 transition-[transform,opacity] duration-300","style":"width: 15px; height: 15px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-shimmer","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/down_chevron.svg\");"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"ml-[16px] pr-0 sm:pr-[12px] mt-4 mb-[10px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 w-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex items-center justify-center w-4 h-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"ws-fade-in inline-flex"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-loader.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"loading","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-spin-anim","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-loader.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-loader.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-loader.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 pb-[10px]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"Turning what you want to know into a plan to find it out."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"Hercules is making your goals concrete — defining what each objective means in practice, what success looks like, and how each goal connects to the business question."]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 w-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex items-center justify-center w-4 h-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"ws-fade-in inline-flex"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-loader.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"loading","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-spin-anim","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-loader.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-loader.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-loader.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 "},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"Goals, audience, methodology — all in one place."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"The brief has been partially built — but Hercules has flagged areas where more secondary context is needed, and is now searching for it before locking in the methodology."]]]]]]]]]]]]]],[[168,141]],[[1437,191]]]]]],[[9,546]]]]]]]]]],[[1453,474]],[[1453,475]],[[1453,476]]],[[1453,623]],[[1414,151]],[[1437,236]],[[1414,152]],[[1129,116]],[[1052,78]],[[952,144]],[[875,82]],[[568,160]],[[491,88]],[[22,601]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":363676.151,"wallTime":1786698775285,"collectionTime":5.0999999940395355,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
