c digital-learning systems. PM e-VIDYA is designed to provide multi-mode digital and online education access to nearly 25 crore school-going children, according to the Government of India. (","pmevidya.education.gov.in",") DIKSHA also demonstrates the scale and institutional relevance of curriculum-linked digital learning, with extensive state, union-territory, teacher, and learner participation, according to the Government of India’s DIKSHA platform and parliamentary reporting. ([diksha.gov.in](","https://diksha.gov.i"]],[[4,543]]]]]],[[4,548]],[[4,549]]]]]]]],[[244,141]],[[1513,191]]]]]],[[4,572]]]]]]]]]],[[1529,474]],[[1529,475]],[[1529,476]]],[[1529,623]],[[1490,151]],[[1513,236]],[[1490,152]],[[1205,116]],[[1128,78]],[[1028,144]],[[951,82]],[[644,160]],[[567,88]],[[98,601]],[[4,582]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":459235.618,"wallTime":1786698870816,"collectionTime":6.600000023841858,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
