linear modular questionnaire with role-based routing and a general-to-specific funnel"],". The study currently contains ",["STRONG",{},"zero discrete stimuli"],": content relevance, adaptive learning, feedback, social learning, and gamification are experience domains rather than defined screens, prototyp"]],[[24,543]]]]]],[[24,548]],[[24,549]]]]]]]],[[264,141]],[[1533,191]]]]]],[[24,572]]]]]]]]]],[[1549,474]],[[1549,475]],[[1549,476]]],[[1549,623]],[[1510,151]],[[1533,236]],[[1510,152]],[[1225,116]],[[1148,78]],[[1048,144]],[[971,82]],[[664,160]],[[587,88]],[[118,601]],[[24,582]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":484432.289,"wallTime":1786698896009,"collectionTime":3.699999988079071,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
