ive stage and drop-off reasons. Potential users will answer awareness, expectations, alternatives, and trial-barrier questions rather than rating experiences they have not had. Parents, teachers, and administrators will receive role-appropriate modules."],"\n",["P",{},"If LearnSphere provides five or more clearly defined candidate improvements, a ",["STRONG",{},"MaxDiff / Best-Worst Scaling"]," exercise should be added to create a relative priority hierarchy"]],[[28,543]]]]]],[[28,548]],[[28,549]]]]]]]],[[268,141]],[[1537,191]]]]]],[[28,572]]]]]]]]]],[[1553,474]],[[1553,475]],[[1553,476]]],[[1553,623]],[[1514,151]],[[1537,236]],[[1514,152]],[[1229,116]],[[1152,78]],[[1052,144]],[[975,82]],[[668,160]],[[591,88]],[[122,601]],[[28,582]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":489460.779,"wallTime":1786698901038,"collectionTime":4,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
