 recommended sample is large enough to provide a directional overall read with approximately 5% margin-of-error-style precision at a 95% confidence level under simple random-sample assumptions. The sample is intended for strategic diagnosis and subgroup comparison; stakeholder-role findings should be interpreted directionally unless larger role-specific quotas are commissioned."],"\n",["P",{},"The questionnaire will combine fully labelled 5-point scales, behavioural frequency measures, forced-choice prioritisation where appropriate, targeted open-ended probes, NPS with reason questions, and role-specific routing. If a defined list of five or more candidate improvements is supplied, MaxDiff will be added as a prioritisation module rather than a stimulus-cell test."],"\n",["P",{},["STRONG",{},"Data Collection Approach:"]," SuperJ mobile application and web panel, with audience targeting enforced before survey start. Age, gender, city, and NCCS will not be recollected in the questionnaire."],"\n",["P",{},["STRONG",{},"Quality Controls:"]," Embedded attention checks, speeder removal, straight-liner detection, randomised non-ordered lists, open-ended gibberish filtering, termination logic for ineligible r"]],[[88,543]]]]]],[[88,548]],[[88,549]]]]]]]],[[328,141]],[[1597,191]]]]]],[[88,572]]]]]]]]]],[[1613,474]],[[1613,475]],[[1613,476]]],[[1613,623]],[[1574,151]],[[1597,236]],[[1574,152]],[[1289,116]],[[1212,78]],[[1112,144]],[[1035,82]],[[728,160]],[[651,88]],[[182,601]],[[88,582]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":565527.27,"wallTime":1786698977103,"collectionTime":5.100000023841858,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
