[4,57]],[[4,59]],[[4,60]],[[4,64]],[[4,65]],["P",{},[[4,67]]," Embedded attention checks, speeder removal, straight-liner detection, randomised non-ordered lists, open-ended gibberish filtering, termination logic for ineligible respondents, and separate reporting by LearnSphere relationship and stakeholder role."],"\n",["HR"],"\n",["H3",{"node":"[object Object]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex-shrink-0 gap-[8px] flex items-center","style":"transform: translateZ(0px);"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/icons/asterisk.svg","alt":"star icon","class":"hchat-icon flex-shrink-0","src":"/icons/asterisk.svg","style":"width: 18px; height: 18px; min-width: 18px; min-height: 18px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; will-change: transform;"}],["DIV",{},["STRONG",{},"Target Audience"]," ",["BUTTON",{"class":"text-[#027CFE] hover:text-[#005FCC] transition-colors duration-200 roboto_ffe159c6-module__GmseOq__className font-normal text-[14px] leading-[120%] underline underline-offset-[2px]"},"See why"]]]],"\n",["P",{},"The target audience will include verified Indian adults who can provide relevant evidence about LearnSphere or comparable digital-learning experiences. The sample will deliberately separate current learners, former or inactive learners, potential users, parents or guardians, teachers or instructors, and academic administrators. This structure reflects the approved framework: learners provide primary experience and completion evidence, while other stakeholders answer role-specific questions rather than being combined into a single learner satisfaction score."],"\n",["P",{},["STRONG",{},"Total Sample Size:"]," 500 responden"]],[[92,543]]]]]],[[92,548]],[[92,549]]]]]]]],[[332,141]],[[1601,191]]]]]],[[92,572]]]]]]]]]],[[1617,474]],[[1617,475]],[[1617,476]]],[[1617,623]],[[1578,151]],[[1601,236]],[[1578,152]],[[1293,116]],[[1216,78]],[[1116,144]],[[1039,82]],[[732,160]],[[655,88]],[[186,601]],[[92,582]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":57