e, reside in India, confirm their relevant stakeholder role, and demonstrate sufficient familiarity with LearnSphere or comparable digital learning to answer the routed module. Current and former learners must report recent or past platform use. Potential users must have a relevant learning need and experience with at least one alternative learning route. Parents, teachers, instructors, and administrators must have direct influence over or professional involvement in learning decisions, delivery, monitoring, or implementation."],"\n",["P",{},"The sample splits are independent dimensions of the same 500 respondents: gender totals 500, age totals 500, and city totals 500. Stakeholder-role percentages are routing quotas and may overlap where a respondent legitimately holds more than one relevant role."]]]],["DIV",{"class":"absolute right-[48%] -bottom-4 bg-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center border border-[#BBBBBB] shadow-[0px_2px_4px_0px_#0000001F] hover:bg-[#E9E9E9] cursor-pointer"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"","alt":"toggle","loading":"lazy","width":"10","height":"10","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"rotate-180 transition-all duration-300","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fdown-arrow.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fdown-arrow.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fdown-arrow.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 10px; height: 10px;"}]]]],["DIV",{"class":"text-[15.5px] text-[#464646] whitespace-pre-wrap mt-16","style":"user-select: text; cursor: text; opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"hchat hchat-md inline-block"},["P",{},"Please review the methodology and audience structure befo"],["SPAN",{"class":"ml-0.5 inline-block w-[4px] h-[1em] bg-[#464646] animate-blink align-baseline"}]]],[[104,548]],[[104,549]]]]]]]],[[344,141]],[[1613,191]]]]]],[[104,572]]]]]]]]]],[[1629,474]],[[1629,475]],[[1629,476]]],[[1629,623]],[[1590,151]],[[1613,236]],[[1590,152]],[[1305,116]],[[