ration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"Hercules is wiring the routing logic to the live survey — translating abstract branching rules into concrete conditional logic tied to real question IDs."]]]]]]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},["DIV",{"class":"text-[#22252A]","style":"user-select: text; cursor: text; opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"hchat hchat-md w-full hchat-md--streaming"},["H3",{},"Survey ready"],"\n",["P",{},"Your survey draft, ",["STRONG",{},"“Why Are Learners Leaving LearnSphere?”"],", is ready with ",["STRONG",{},"25 respondent-facing questions"],". It follows the approved linear structure and is designed to distinguish the experiences of current, inactive, potential, parent, teacher, and administrator audiences where relevant."],"\n",["H3",{},"Research strategy"],"\n",["P",{},"This is a ",["STRONG",{},"mixed-methodology, multi-objective study"]," combining usage and attitude research, learner experience measurement, churn/exit diagnosis, competitive evaluation, and feature prioritization. The findings will help LearnSphere determine which learner-experience, content, motivation, feedback, technology, and journey issues to address first to increase sustained engagement, course completion, return usage, and recommendations—and identify which inactive learners may be recoverable."],"\n",["H3",{},"Survey structure"],"\n",["P",{},"Respondents move through six ordered sections: ",["STRONG",{},"Hook, Warm-Up & Screening; Usage & Behavior; Attitude & Motivation; CX/Satisfaction; Competitive; and Future Intent/Close"],". The flow starts with recent behavior and last-active-stage reconstruction, then explores friction and motivations before measuring satisfaction, competitive perceptions, win-back opportunities, and priorities for improvement. It closes with future intent and an open-ended improvement question."],"\n",["H3",{},"Routing & logic"],"\n",["P",{},"Smart branching and screening logic has been built in, with ",["STRONG",{},"6 routing rules"]," covering branching, skip logic, and screening gates. ",["STRONG",{},"2 dynamic carry-forward filters"]," also tailor follow-up questions based on respondents’ earlier answers."],"\n",["H3",{},"Invitation to review"],"\n",["P",{},"Please review the draft and let me know if you’d like to adjust the audience definitions, wordi"]]],["DIV"],["DIV",{"style":"height: 5px; width: 100%;"}]]]]]]],[[360,141]],[[1629,191]]]]]],["DIV",{"id":"questionnaire-floating-anchor","class":"w-full relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mb-[19px] md:mt-0 "},["DIV",{"class":"border border-transparent w-full max-w-[800px] flex flex-col"}," ",["DIV",{"class":"z-[1] self-center w-[90%] md:max-w-[750px] bg-[#C0E0F8] border-[#87BADF] relative -mb-[1px] py-[7px] border-[0.6px] rounded-tr-[9px] rounded-tl-[9px] px-[12px]"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"flex  justify-between items-start  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex  justify-between items-start  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"inline-block items-center font-inter text-[#46657B] text-[14px] leading-[140%] tracking-[0%] font-normal"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-semibold underline cursor-pointer mr-2"},"Keep Learning: The LearnSphere Experience"],"Audience set has been applied to this campaign"]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"relative w-full flex justify-center"},["DIV",{"class":"relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center"},[[1629,196]],["DIV",{"class":" w-full bg-white md:w-full shadow-[0px_1px_42px_0px_#00000012] border-[0.6px] border-[#BFBFBF] rounded-[12px] md:rounded-[20px] px-[10px] md:px-5 py-[10px] md:py-4 sticky bottom-5 z-10   overflow-visible max-w-[800px] max-h-[460px]"},[[1629,198]],["DIV",{"class":"flex items-