ected research decision refers to meal preparation and nutrition, so I need to resolve that mismatch before designing the study."]]],["DIV"],["DIV",{"style":"height: 5px; width: 100%;"}]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-end pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0 mb-4 mt-[24px]"},["DIV",{"class":" justify-center mt-6 mb-6 items-start w-full bg-[#F7FBFF] rounded-[12px] border border-[#C4C7C780] "},["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"1"],". ","What should this survey ultimately help LearnSphere decide? Please describe the main decision in your own words, especially how the findings should guide the proposed VR, translation, career coaching, or productivity-tool features."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Our product is an all-in-one, cloud-based project management and collaboration platform called 'ProjectPro'. It currently offers a range of features, including task assignment and tracking, team member onboarding and management, real-time file sharing and version control, automated workflows and approval processes, customizable dashboards and reporting, and integration with popular third-party tools such as Google Drive, Slack, and Trello. ProjectPro is designed to help teams of all sizes streamline their workflows, improve communication, and increase productivity. We are considering adding several new features to ProjectPro, including a built-in time tracking and billing system, a more advanced analytics and reporting module, and a mobile app for on-the-go access to project information. The new features will be designed to further enhance the platform's capabilities and make it an even more indispensable tool for teams and organizations."]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"2"],". ","Which one is the primary research objective for LearnSphere?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Evaluate LearnSphere’s overall user experience and satisfaction"]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-start pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full justify-start"}],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0  mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"mb-8 pointer-events-auto"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full max-w-[800px] mt-[12px]"},["STYLE",{},"\n/* One sweep (~2.7s), then a ~0.3s rest, per 3s iteration. The travel is exactly one\n   tile period (background-size 200% → a 200% shift), so the loop point is\n   seamless. The rest frames hold at 200% ≡ 0%, where the visible window shows\n   only the gradient's flat #B8B8B8 half (highlight lives in the 50–100% stops),\n   so nothing is frozen mid-text during the pause — the text just sits gray. */\n@keyframes ws-shimmer-sweep { 0% { background-position: 0% 0; animation-timing-function: ease-in-out; } 90% { background-position: 200% 0; } 100% { background-position: 200% 0; } }\n@keyframes ws-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n@keyframes ws-fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n.ws-fade-in { animation: ws-fade-in 0.45s ease-out both; }\n.ws-spin-anim { animation: ws-spin 0.7s linear infinite; }\n/* Header icon shimmer — exactly synced with the title ShimmerText: same gradient\n   (#B8B8B8 base, #464646 sweeping highlight), same background-size, same keyframe\n   and 3s timing. The icon SVG is the mask, so the gradient fills the icon's\n   shape (replaces its color while streaming, mirroring the text clip). */\n.ws-icon-shimmer {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #464646 0%, #464646 50%, #B8B8B8 75%, #464646 100%);\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: ws-shimmer-sweep 3s linear infinite;\n}\n/* Recolorable icon — a single masked span whose background-color IS the icon\n   color. Two clear states: mid-gray #6B6B6B at rest, darkening to the text's\n   hover color #343434 on header hover. (Matching the text's #464646→#343434\n   exactly was imperceptible — text hover reads via font-weight, icons can't do\n   that, so they need a wider color gap.) One element for both states, so the\n   icon's size/position can't shift on hover. */\n.ws-icon-tint {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-color: #6B6B6B;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.group:hover .ws-icon-tint { background-color: #343434; }\n.ws-scroll { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #B0B0B0 #ECECEC; overscroll-behavior-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-y; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; -webkit-appearance: none; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #ECECEC; border-radius: 4px; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #B0B0B0; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #ECECEC; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #9A9A9A; }\n"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"false","class":"group flex items-center cursor-pointer select-none"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[6px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block flex-shrink-0","style":"width: 13px; height: 13px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/leaf.svg\");"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_mono_dc771075-module__pIk42a__className flex items-center gap-[3px] text-[13px] font-normal leading-[140%] tracking-normal allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-normal text-[#464646] group-hover:font-medium group-hover:text-[#343434] transition-colors duration-200"},"Full context read before anything gets built"]]],["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block self-center flex-shrink-0 ml-[4px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 scale-y-100 transition-[transform,opacity] duration-300","style":"width: 15px; height: 15px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/down_chevron.svg\");"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 0fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"ml-[16px] mt-4 mb-[10px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 w-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex items-center justify-center w-4 h-4"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"done","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-fade-in","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 "},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"Building clarity about what needs to be proven before proving it."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"Your inputs are being read in full — Hercules is building a structured understanding of your research situation before anything is designed around it."]]]]]]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},["DIV",{"class":"text-[#22252A]","style":"user-select: text; cursor: text; opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"hchat hchat-md w-full"},["P",{},"Thanks — I see a mismatch between ",["STRONG",{},"LearnSphere"]," and ",["STRONG",{},"ProjectPro"],", so I need to confirm the subject before designing the study."]]],["DIV"],["DIV",{"style":"height: 5px; width: 100%;"}]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-end pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0 mb-4 mt-[24px]"},["DIV",{"class":" justify-center mt-6 mb-6 items-start w-full bg-[#F7FBFF] rounded-[12px] border border-[#C4C7C780] "},["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"1"],". ","Which product should this survey focus on, and what is its correct name? Please describe the product or service in your own words."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"The product in question is an e-learning platform called 'LearnSphere' that offers a comprehensive online education experience for students of all ages. Currently, LearnSphere provides a vast library of video courses, interactive quizzes, and personalized learning plans tailored to individual students' needs. It also features a social learning component that allows students to connect with peers, ask questions, and collaborate on projects. The platform is accessible on both web and mobile devices, making it convenient for students to learn on-the-go. Our team is considering adding several new features to LearnSphere, including an AI-powered adaptive learning engine that can adjust the difficulty level and content of courses based on a student's performance, a virtual reality (VR) and augmented reality (AR) component that can enhance the learning experience through immersive simulations, and a gamification feature that rewards students for achieving milestones and completing challenging tasks. We also plan to integrate LearnSphere with popular productivity and organization tools, such as Google Calendar and Trello, to help students better manage their time and stay organized. Additionally, we aim to expand the platform's content offerings to include more courses and resources on emerging technologies, such as artificial intelligence, blockchain, and cybersecurity."]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"2"],". ","What should the survey primarily evaluate?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Both current satisfaction and interest in new features"]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-start pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full justify-start"}],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0  mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"mb-8 pointer-events-auto"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full max-w-[800px] mt-[12px]"},["STYLE",{},"\n/* One sweep (~2.7s), then a ~0.3s rest, per 3s iteration. The travel is exactly one\n   tile period (background-size 200% → a 200% shift), so the loop point is\n   seamless. The rest frames hold at 200% ≡ 0%, where the visible window shows\n   only the gradient's flat #B8B8B8 half (highlight lives in the 50–100% stops),\n   so nothing is frozen mid-text during the pause — the text just sits gray. */\n@keyframes ws-shimmer-sweep { 0% { background-position: 0% 0; animation-timing-function: ease-in-out; } 90% { background-position: 200% 0; } 100% { background-position: 200% 0; } }\n@keyframes ws-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n@keyframes ws-fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n.ws-fade-in { animation: ws-fade-in 0.45s ease-out both; }\n.ws-spin-anim { animation: ws-spin 0.7s linear infinite; }\n/* Header icon shimmer — exactly synced with the title ShimmerText: same gradient\n   (#B8B8B8 base, #464646 sweeping highlight), same background-size, same keyframe\n   and 3s timing. The icon SVG is the mask, so the gradient fills the icon's\n   shape (replaces its color while streaming, mirroring the text clip). */\n.ws-icon-shimmer {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #464646 0%, #464646 50%, #B8B8B8 75%, #464646 100%);\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: ws-shimmer-sweep 3s linear infinite;\n}\n/* Recolorable icon — a single masked span whose background-color IS the icon\n   color. Two clear states: mid-gray #6B6B6B at rest, darkening to the text's\n   hover color #343434 on header hover. (Matching the text's #464646→#343434\n   exactly was imperceptible — text hover reads via font-weight, icons can't do\n   that, so they need a wider color gap.) One element for both states, so the\n   icon's size/position can't shift on hover. */\n.ws-icon-tint {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-color: #6B6B6B;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.group:hover .ws-icon-tint { background-color: #343434; }\n.ws-scroll { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #B0B0B0 #ECECEC; overscroll-behavior-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-y; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; -webkit-appearance: none; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #ECECEC; border-radius: 4px; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #B0B0B0; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #ECECEC; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #9A9A9A; }\n"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"false","class":"group flex items-center cursor-pointer select-none"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[6px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block flex-shrink-0","style":"width: 13px; height: 13px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/leaf.svg\");"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_mono_dc771075-module__pIk42a__className flex items-center gap-[3px] text-[13px] font-normal leading-[140%] tracking-normal allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-normal text-[#464646] group-hover:font-medium group-hover:text-[#343434] transition-colors duration-200"},"Taking stock of what's been shared"]]],["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block self-center flex-shrink-0 ml-[4px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 scale-y-100 transition-[transform,opacity] duration-300","style":"width: 15px; height: 15px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/down_chevron.svg\");"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 0fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"ml-[16px] mt-4 mb-[10px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 w-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex items-center justify-center w-4 h-4"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"done","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-fade-in","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 "},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"Framework first — questions later."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"Before any framework is built, Hercules reads the full context — goals, audience signals, category dynamics, and anything else shared — so the structure it builds is grounded in your actual situation."]]]]]]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},["DIV",{"class":"text-[#22252A]","style":"user-select: text; cursor: text; opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"hchat hchat-md w-full"},["P",{},"Thanks — LearnSphere and the combined focus on current satisfaction plus interest in new features are clear. I need a few more details to design the right study and avoid treating all learners or features alike."]]],["DIV"],["DIV",{"style":"height: 5px; width: 100%;"}]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-end pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0 mb-4 mt-[24px]"},["DIV",{"class":" justify-center mt-6 mb-6 items-start w-full bg-[#F7FBFF] rounded-[12px] border border-[#C4C7C780] "},["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"1"],". ","Who should answer this survey? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Current LearnSphere students, Parents or guardians who influence learning decisions, Students who tried LearnSphere but are now inactive, People who use other online learning platforms but not LearnSphere"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"2"],". ","Which LearnSphere experiences should the satisfaction section cover? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Video courses and content quality, Interactive quizzes and assessments, Personalized learning plans, Social learning, peer questions, and collaboration, Web and mobile app experience"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"3"],". ","Which feature areas should be evaluated for learner interest? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"AI-powered adaptive learning, VR and AR immersive simulations, Gamification, rewards, and milestones, Google Calendar or Trello integrations"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"4"],". ","What is the single most important decision this research should support?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Identify improvements needed in the current LearnSphere experience"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"5"],". ","What stage are these proposed features at right now?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Early ideas requiring initial demand assessment"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"6"],". ","What would you do differently depending on the survey results? Please describe the decision or action in your own words."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"The product in question is an e-commerce platform called 'GreenCycle' that specializes in sustainable and eco-friendly household products. Currently, GreenCycle offers a wide range of products, including reusable bags, refillable water bottles, bamboo toothbrushes, and biodegradable cleaning supplies. The platform allows customers to browse and purchase products through its user-friendly website and mobile app. GreenCycle also features a rewards program, where customers can earn points for every purchase and redeem them for discounts and free products. Additionally, the platform offers a 'Product of the Month' subscription service, where customers can receive a new, eco-friendly product every month. We are considering adding new features to GreenCycle, including a 'Product Recommendation' algorithm that suggests products to customers based on their purchase history and preferences, a 'Sustainability Score' feature that rates products based on their environmental impact, and a 'Community Forum' where customers can discuss sustainable living and share tips and advice."]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-start pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full justify-start"}],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0  mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"mb-8 pointer-events-auto"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full max-w-[800px] mt-[12px]"},["STYLE",{},"\n/* One sweep (~2.7s), then a ~0.3s rest, per 3s iteration. The travel is exactly one\n   tile period (background-size 200% → a 200% shift), so the loop point is\n   seamless. The rest frames hold at 200% ≡ 0%, where the visible window shows\n   only the gradient's flat #B8B8B8 half (highlight lives in the 50–100% stops),\n   so nothing is frozen mid-text during the pause — the text just sits gray. */\n@keyframes ws-shimmer-sweep { 0% { background-position: 0% 0; animation-timing-function: ease-in-out; } 90% { background-position: 200% 0; } 100% { background-position: 200% 0; } }\n@keyframes ws-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n@keyframes ws-fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n.ws-fade-in { animation: ws-fade-in 0.45s ease-out both; }\n.ws-spin-anim { animation: ws-spin 0.7s linear infinite; }\n/* Header icon shimmer — exactly synced with the title ShimmerText: same gradient\n   (#B8B8B8 base, #464646 sweeping highlight), same background-size, same keyframe\n   and 3s timing. The icon SVG is the mask, so the gradient fills the icon's\n   shape (replaces its color while streaming, mirroring the text clip). */\n.ws-icon-shimmer {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #464646 0%, #464646 50%, #B8B8B8 75%, #464646 100%);\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: ws-shimmer-sweep 3s linear infinite;\n}\n/* Recolorable icon — a single masked span whose background-color IS the icon\n   color. Two clear states: mid-gray #6B6B6B at rest, darkening to the text's\n   hover color #343434 on header hover. (Matching the text's #464646→#343434\n   exactly was imperceptible — text hover reads via font-weight, icons can't do\n   that, so they need a wider color gap.) One element for both states, so the\n   icon's size/position can't shift on hover. */\n.ws-icon-tint {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-color: #6B6B6B;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.group:hover .ws-icon-tint { background-color: #343434; }\n.ws-scroll { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #B0B0B0 #ECECEC; overscroll-behavior-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-y; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; -webkit-appearance: none; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #ECECEC; border-radius: 4px; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #B0B0B0; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #ECECEC; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #9A9A9A; }\n"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"false","class":"group flex items-center cursor-pointer select-none"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[6px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block flex-shrink-0","style":"width: 13px; height: 13px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/leaf.svg\");"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_mono_dc771075-module__pIk42a__className flex items-center gap-[3px] text-[13px] font-normal leading-[140%] tracking-normal allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-normal text-[#464646] group-hover:font-medium group-hover:text-[#343434] transition-colors duration-200"},"Your inputs are being processed — nothing assumed yet"]]],["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block self-center flex-shrink-0 ml-[4px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 scale-y-100 transition-[transform,opacity] duration-300","style":"width: 15px; height: 15px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/down_chevron.svg\");"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 0fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"ml-[16px] mt-4 mb-[10px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 w-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex items-center justify-center w-4 h-4"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"done","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-fade-in","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 "},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"Structural thinking before survey writing."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"The context layer is active — your goals, constraints, and category context are being read, organised, and structured before any framework is built."]]]]]]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},["DIV",{"class":"text-[#22252A]","style":"user-select: text; cursor: text; opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"hchat hchat-md w-full"},["P",{},"I see a mismatch between the LearnSphere answers and the GreenCycle description, so I need to confirm the actual subject before designing the study."]]],["DIV"],["DIV",{"style":"height: 5px; width: 100%;"}]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-end pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0 mb-4 mt-[24px]"},["DIV",{"class":" justify-center mt-6 mb-6 items-start w-full bg-[#F7FBFF] rounded-[12px] border border-[#C4C7C780] "},["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"1"],". ","Which product or service is this survey actually about? Please describe the one you want to research: LearnSphere, GreenCycle, or another product/service."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"The product in question is an e-learning platform called 'LearnSphere' that offers a comprehensive online education experience for students of all ages. Currently, LearnSphere provides access to a vast library of video lectures, interactive quizzes, and personalized learning plans, all tailored to meet the unique needs of each student. The platform also features a social learning component, allowing students to connect with peers and instructors, as well as a progress tracking system to monitor their academic growth. With the new features we are considering adding, we aim to enhance the overall user experience, increase engagement, and provide more effective learning outcomes. Specifically, we are looking to integrate AI-powered adaptive learning tools, real-time feedback mechanisms, and gamification elements to make the learning process more enjoyable and interactive. We also plan to expand our content offerings to include more specialized courses and certifications, as well as partner with leading educational institutions to provide students with access to high-quality, industry-recognized content. Ultimately, our goal is to create a seamless, intuitive, and supportive learning environment that empowers students to achieve their full potential and succeed in their academic and professional pursuits."]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"2"],". ","What is the single most important decision this research should support?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Improve the current customer or learner experience"]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-start pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full justify-start"}],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0  mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"mb-8 pointer-events-auto"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full max-w-[800px] mt-[12px]"},["STYLE",{},"\n/* One sweep (~2.7s), then a ~0.3s rest, per 3s iteration. The travel is exactly one\n   tile period (background-size 200% → a 200% shift), so the loop point is\n   seamless. The rest frames hold at 200% ≡ 0%, where the visible window shows\n   only the gradient's flat #B8B8B8 half (highlight lives in the 50–100% stops),\n   so nothing is frozen mid-text during the pause — the text just sits gray. */\n@keyframes ws-shimmer-sweep { 0% { background-position: 0% 0; animation-timing-function: ease-in-out; } 90% { background-position: 200% 0; } 100% { background-position: 200% 0; } }\n@keyframes ws-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n@keyframes ws-fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n.ws-fade-in { animation: ws-fade-in 0.45s ease-out both; }\n.ws-spin-anim { animation: ws-spin 0.7s linear infinite; }\n/* Header icon shimmer — exactly synced with the title ShimmerText: same gradient\n   (#B8B8B8 base, #464646 sweeping highlight), same background-size, same keyframe\n   and 3s timing. The icon SVG is the mask, so the gradient fills the icon's\n   shape (replaces its color while streaming, mirroring the text clip). */\n.ws-icon-shimmer {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #464646 0%, #464646 50%, #B8B8B8 75%, #464646 100%);\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: ws-shimmer-sweep 3s linear infinite;\n}\n/* Recolorable icon — a single masked span whose background-color IS the icon\n   color. Two clear states: mid-gray #6B6B6B at rest, darkening to the text's\n   hover color #343434 on header hover. (Matching the text's #464646→#343434\n   exactly was imperceptible — text hover reads via font-weight, icons can't do\n   that, so they need a wider color gap.) One element for both states, so the\n   icon's size/position can't shift on hover. */\n.ws-icon-tint {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-color: #6B6B6B;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.group:hover .ws-icon-tint { background-color: #343434; }\n.ws-scroll { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #B0B0B0 #ECECEC; overscroll-behavior-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-y; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; -webkit-appearance: none; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #ECECEC; border-radius: 4px; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #B0B0B0; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #ECECEC; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #9A9A9A; }\n"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"false","class":"group flex items-center cursor-pointer select-none"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[6px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block flex-shrink-0","style":"width: 13px; height: 13px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/leaf.svg\");"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_mono_dc771075-module__pIk42a__className flex items-center gap-[3px] text-[13px] font-normal leading-[140%] tracking-normal allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-normal text-[#464646] group-hover:font-medium group-hover:text-[#343434] transition-colors duration-200"},"Loading your context before building anything"]]],["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block self-center flex-shrink-0 ml-[4px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 scale-y-100 transition-[transform,opacity] duration-300","style":"width: 15px; height: 15px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/down_chevron.svg\");"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 0fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"ml-[16px] mt-4 mb-[10px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 w-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex items-center justify-center w-4 h-4"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"done","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-fade-in","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%