t w-full bg-[#F7FBFF] rounded-[12px] border border-[#C4C7C780] "},["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"1"],". ","Who should answer this survey? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Current LearnSphere students, Former or inactive LearnSphere students, Parents or guardians who influence learning decisions, Teachers, instructors, or academic administrators, Potential users who do not currently use LearnSphere"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"2"],". ","Which parts of the LearnSphere experience should the research examine? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Content quality and course relevance, Video lectures, quizzes, and learning plans, AI-powered adaptive learning tools, Real-time feedback and progress tracking, Social learning with peers and instructors, Gamification and engagement"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"3"],". ","What is the single most important decision the research should support?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Improve learner engagement and course completion"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"4"],". ","What has triggered this research now? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Learner feedback or complaints, Low engagement or course completion, Feature planning for the next product release, Competitive pressure from other e-learning platforms, Expansion into certifications or institutional partnerships"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"5"],". ","How familiar are the people you want to survey with LearnSphere?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"A mix of current, former, and potential users"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"6"],". ","What is the timeline for using the research results?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"No strict deadline"]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-start pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full justify-start"}],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0  mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"mb-8 pointer-events-auto"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full max-w-[800px] mt-