enter justify-center w-4 h-4"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"done","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-fade-in","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 "},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"Turning the brief into a live survey."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"Hercules is wiring the routing logic to the live survey — translating abstract branching rules into concrete conditional logic tied to real question IDs."]]]]]]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},["DIV",{"class":"text-[#22252A]","style":"user-select: text; cursor: text; opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"hchat hchat-md w-full"},["H3",{},"Survey ready"],"\n",["P",{},"Your survey draft, ",["STRONG",{},"“Why Are Learners Leaving LearnSphere?”"],", is ready with ",["STRONG",{},"25 respondent-facing questions"],". It follows the approved linear structure and is designed to distinguish the experiences of current, inactive, potential, parent, teacher, and administrator audiences where relevant."],"\n",["H3",{},"Research strategy"],"\n",["P",{},"This is a ",["STRONG",{},"mixed-methodology, multi-objective study"]," combining usage and attitude research, learner experience measurement, churn/exit diagnosis, competitive evaluation, and feature prioritization. The findings will help LearnSphere determine which learner-experience, content, motivation, feedback, technology, and journey issues to address first to increase sustained engagement, course completion, return usage, and recommendations—and identify which inactive learners may be recoverable."],"\n",["H3",{},"Survey structure"],"\n",["P",{},"Respondents move through six ordered sections: ",["STRONG",{},"Hook, Warm-Up & Screening; Usage & Behavior; Attitude & Motivation; CX/Satisfaction; Competitive; and Future Intent/Close"],". The flow starts with recent behavior and last-active-stage reconstruction, then explores friction and motivations before measuring satisfaction, competitive perceptions, win-back opportunities, and priorities for improvement. It closes with future intent and an open-ended improvement question."],"\n",["H3",{},"Routing & logic"],"\n",["P",{},"Smart branching and screening logic has been built in, with ",["STRONG",{},"6 routing rules"]," covering branching, skip logic, and screening gates. ",["STRONG",{},"2 dynamic carry-forward filters"]," also tailor follow-up questions based on respondents’ earlier answers."],"\n",["H3",{},"Invitation to review"],"\n",["P",{},"Please review the draft and let me know if you’d like to adjust the audience definitions, wording, response options, routing, or emphasis on any research goal before fielding."]]],["DIV"],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full mb-[6px]"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"opacity-100 flex pt-[14px] pb-[14px] px-4  border-[.8px] cursor-pointer mt-7 rounded-[14px] w-full justify-between relative transition-colors duration-200 overflow-hidden ","tabindex":"0","style":"background-color: rgb(253, 246, 240); border-color: rgb(235, 213, 207);"},["D